content.text:
Now add scene-sky CSS. Need decide markup. Add `<div class="scene-sky" aria-hidden="true"></div>` before canvas. Stage background remains. CSS z-index 0; stage::before grid z-index 0 currently and canvas z-index 1. `.stage::before` is grid, `.scene-sky` z-index 0 too, ordering: stage::before generated first, scene-sky child after? z-index same, DOM order: pseudo before then child then canvas. So scene-sky above grid; fine. The grid may show over scene art? It's okay.

Scene-sky styles:
```css
.scene-sky { position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:0; pointer-events:none; overflow:hidden; }
.scene-sky::before, .scene-sky::after { content:""; position:absolute; }
